# BITA - Bit Test A (Immediate: 0x85)

---
name: immediate zero result
memory: 85 0F
setup: a=F0
# BITA does not modify A
expect: a=F0 Z=1 N=0 V=0
cycles: 2

---
name: direct nonzero
memory: 95 42
setup: a=FF
at 0042: 0F
expect: a=FF N=0 Z=0 V=0
cycles: 3

---
name: indexed
memory: A5 10
setup: a=FF x=1000
at 1010: 80
expect: a=FF N=1 Z=0 V=0
cycles: 4

---
name: extended
memory: B5 12 34
setup: a=FF
at 1234: 42
expect: a=FF N=0 Z=0 V=0
cycles: 4
